      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "We've figured out the common thread between the avatar sounds dying, it's only on avatars with more than 3 audio sources. It seems like there was some attempt to curb volume limit bypassing, but it backfired because it didn't have any nuance for audio sources having different clips and playtimes.",
